      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would also appreciate if the tagging system from avatars made their way into the sticker system. That way users don't have to see content that they do not want to interact with in the first place. \n\nThis content should automatically (and forcefully) be tagged by the system to reduce instances of abuse and allow users to share content which may not be NSFW, but may contain any of the other contents in the tagging system.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
