  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In the report menu for stickers, prints, and particularly Emojis (since emojis can be animated); it would be useful to have all visual content automatically spoilered (similar to how Discord image spoilering), where its blurred, and you click on it one at a time to un-spoiler it, or re-spoiler it.\n\nFor those users that may spam NSFW or Gore emojis, the last thing people want to do is to have to look at the images or gifs they sent AGAIN just to report it. I myself make a whole vrchat ticket to report them just to avoid seeing it again, which then clutters up VRC's ticket report system with something that could have easily been reported ingame.\n\nHaving them be unspoilered is also abysmal for if trolls spam it, and then send one near people so when they go to report it, they open the report menu to see all their spammed NSFW/gore emojis all in one place :[\n\nHaving them be spoilered would help prevent the entire menu from being flooded with NSFW imagery when trying to report and avoid those kind of scenarios.\n\nWhen exiting and entering the report menu, it should also always default to being spoiled, even if you had been in it and unspoiled, then went out and back in.\n\nthat ORRR have it so you have to HOLD the eye button to see it unspoilered, and when letting go, it spoileres again.",
